        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Opulent/mission_stingray/scene_stingray_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 328df783-28d3-40ce-8f5a-3817a356d0ed).Image",
        "Description": "Your targets are Diego de la Torres and Jim Murphy, two former members of a mysterious underground cult that worships giant flying rubber duck-shaped explosive devices as deities. Our client, the widow of one of the cult&apos;s latest Sacrifices, has requested we return their kindness in turn. You are to eliminate the targets in the same way they eliminated their Sacrifice. You must also manage to escape unseen, as the client wishes for the cult to believe their gods are angered. Good luck, 47.",
